					"content": "派蒙，我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741421403,
					"content": "这次也好快！我还来不及眨眼呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421404,
					"content": "…那就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741421405,
					"content": "#好啦！罪魁祸首也回来啦，夏诺蒂拉，你害得{NICKNAME}好担心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421406,
					"content": "我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421407,
					"content": "呜呜，对不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421408,
					"content": "哎？呃…我没有在责备你啦！夏诺蒂拉不哭，我给你吃好吃的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421409,
					"content": "（发生了什么呀？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421410,
					"content": "（里面遇到了一些危险。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421411
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741421411,
					"content": "（是喔…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421412,
					"content": "不哭不哭，夏诺蒂拉好勇敢！来，夏诺蒂拉，这是我最喜欢的野菇鸡肉串，给你做奖励！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421413,
					"content": "呜呜…谢谢派蒙…嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421414,
					"content": "（咀嚼）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421415,
					"content": "呜哇，好怪的味道，这就是人吃的饭吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421416,
					"content": "什么嘛！你不吃那还给我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421417,
					"content": "#但是…谢谢派蒙。还有谢谢{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}，谢谢你救了我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421418,
					"content": "之后有什么打算？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421419
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741421419,
					"content": "不知道，但我再也不想看书了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421420,
					"content": "…夏诺蒂拉，这是否有点极端了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421421,
					"content": "唔，但是「揭示之书」真的很可怕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421422,
					"content": "（所以到底发生了什么呀？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421423,
					"content": "（很难解释…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421424,
						741421425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741421424,
					"content": "（你要去了才知道。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421426
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741421426,
					"content": "（什么嘛！真气人…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421427,
					"content": "…总之，我不要呆在这里了，我要和大家一起住在海沫村里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421428,
					"content": "那就对啦！别的美露莘会好好照顾你的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421429,
					"content": "#嗯。谢谢你们，{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}、派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741421425,
					"content": "（还好你没去。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421426
					]
				}
			]
